# Runtime files produced by the events/RSVP subsystem - never commit these.
# They contain live submission traces including personal-data field names.
events/error_log
events/*.log
events/*.lock
**/error_log
**/access_log
*.log
*.lock

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Claude Code tooling.
#
# .agents/ and .claude/skills/ are two byte-identical copies of the same
# third-party skills, vendored from someone else's repo and materialised
# from skills-lock.json. They are developer tooling, not part of the site,
# and nothing in public_html should ever serve them - so track the lockfile
# (which pins source + hash, and is what regenerates them) and ignore the
# vendored copies, the same way a lockfile is tracked but node_modules is not.
#
# .claude/ itself is deliberately NOT ignored: project settings committed
# there later should still be shareable.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
